# Milestone: M6 wave 1
# Origin: legacy tests/2.x/lookup.chk
# Covers: unbound-identifier lookup raises a slot-not-found diagnostic.
#
# The legacy fixture's diagnostic format was
#   `!!! input.u:@.1-8: lookup failed: asdfjklm`
# v1.0 emits `!!! TypeError: GETSLOT: slot 'NAME' not found` from the
# urbi binary's REPL eval path.  Both forms encode the same semantic;
# the chk runner matches the post-`[]` text verbatim, so the actual
# v1.0 message is what is asserted here.

asdfjklm
[00000000:error] !!! TypeError: GETSLOT: slot 'asdfjklm' not found

aoeuhtns
[00000001:error] !!! TypeError: GETSLOT: slot 'aoeuhtns' not found
